language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Cryptarithmetic puzzle: the 20-letter word BAIJJAJIIAHFCFEBBJEA plus the 20-letter word DHFGABCDIDBIFFAGFEJE equals GJEGACDDHFAFJBFIHEEF, each letter a distinct digit.
find A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J : int(0..9)
find carry : matrix indexed by [int(1..21)] of int(0..1)
such that
$ all letters are distinct digits
allDiff([A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J]),
$ the first letter of each number is not zero
B != 0, D != 0, G != 0,
$ no carry comes out of the leftmost column, and no carry goes into the rightmost column
carry[1] = 0, carry[21] = 0,
$ column 1 of the sum (leftmost): the digits B and D plus any carry give G
B + D + carry[2] = G + 10 * carry[1],
$ column 2 of the sum
A + H + carry[3] = J + 10 * carry[2],
$ column 3 of the sum
I + F + carry[4] = E + 10 * carry[3],
$ column 4 of the sum
J + G + carry[5] = G + 10 * carry[4],
$ column 5 of the sum
J + A + carry[6] = A + 10 * carry[5],
$ column 6 of the sum
A + B + carry[7] = C + 10 * carry[6],
$ column 7 of the sum
J + C + carry[8] = D + 10 * carry[7],
$ column 8 of the sum
I + D + carry[9] = D + 10 * carry[8],
$ column 9 of the sum
I + I + carry[10] = H + 10 * carry[9],
$ column 10 of the sum
A + D + carry[11] = F + 10 * carry[10],
$ column 11 of the sum
H + B + carry[12] = A + 10 * carry[11],
$ column 12 of the sum
F + I + carry[13] = F + 10 * carry[12],
$ column 13 of the sum
C + F + carry[14] = J + 10 * carry[13],
$ column 14 of the sum
F + F + carry[15] = B + 10 * carry[14],
$ column 15 of the sum
E + A + carry[16] = F + 10 * carry[15],
$ column 16 of the sum
B + G + carry[17] = I + 10 * carry[16],
$ column 17 of the sum
B + F + carry[18] = H + 10 * carry[17],
$ column 18 of the sum
J + E + carry[19] = E + 10 * carry[18],
$ column 19 of the sum
E + J + carry[20] = E + 10 * carry[19],
$ column 20 of the sum (rightmost column; it carries nothing in)
A + E + carry[21] = F + 10 * carry[20]
